                <pb facs="d430-1" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/d430-1"/>


                <head>Message From Lloyd to Herter</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1959-02-25">February 25,
                        1959</date></dateline>
                    <salute>Dear Chris:</salute>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d430-2" n="2" type="facsimile" xml:id="d430-2"/>
                <p>Mr. Selwyn Lloyd has asked me to give
                    you the information in the enclosed note on points which have so far arisen in
                    the discussions with the Soviet leaders on disarmament. This note does not cover
                    the topics dealt with in the Prime Minister’s message of last night to the
                    President of which I enclose a copy.</p>
                <p>Yours ever,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">/s/ Sammy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
